// A change to the project's own text, live and committed together, or nothing changed (paper-research N-865). An
// agent, or the owner from his window, opens one with the files it wants changed: the project's kinds, calls, policy,
// renderings, the views of its project.toml and its standing text (standing.md). coordd answers `check_text` and
// `load_text` itself, as the worker `coord` (coordd's change.rs): the check applies the change to a copy of the
// project's text and reads it as a reload would, the load writes it, commits it in the project's text repository and
// loads it, all or none.
//
// Who may open one is the project's `Act open`; whether it is read first is the project's decision `text-read`
// (agent-base policy/text-change.eflint, which a project's file of that name replaces), and by whom its `fills` of the
// role `text-reader`, given who made it and the names it touches (paper-research N-1446 p2894; the lead holds the role
// by text-reader.eflint, and a project's policy may give it to others), never the engine's; a change to the
// flavour's look (its `look.toml`, the window's own controls) is the system's decision `look-read`
// (policy/look.eflint), read by the lead, which no project's policy may rule on. A change read first with nobody to
// read it is refused, never the owner's step. The way back is a change with BACK, a commit a change made: its files as
// they were before it.
//
// After the load, an agent's change has one more step, for the agent that made it (consult-lead, N-412 p1203; the
// owner's N-1104 p81, "agent changes can go live they then look at a real ss to see if it works like a human would"):
// `still_text`, which coordd answers with a picture of the page the change touches drawn by a stand-in window that
// took the change the way his window takes it, and `look_at`, the agent's look at that picture. Wrong takes the change
// back by its own commit, its files as they were before it, byte for byte; the way back is loaded as it is, with no
// decision or read, since it puts back what was live before.
/// a change to the project's own text: checked, read where its policy asks, committed and loaded together, and looked at
/// by the agent that made it in a picture of a window drawing it
kind text-change
  form files: [TextFile], back: Ref?, why: Text
  result
    Live(commit: Ref, still: Text?)              /// live, and committed as COMMIT in the project's text repository; STILL the picture the agent that made it found right (none: the owner's own change, which his window draws)
    | Unseen(commit: Ref, why: Text)             /// live and committed as COMMIT, and no window drew it for the agent to look at: why
    | Back(what: Text, still: Text, commit: Ref) /// the agent that made it found the picture STILL wrong (WHAT): taken back as COMMIT, its files as they were before it
    | Stuck(what: Text, still: Text, why: Text)  /// the agent found the picture STILL wrong (WHAT), and the way back was refused (WHY): the change stays live
    | Refused(why: Text, at: [Text])             /// nothing changed and nothing committed: why, and the places (file:line) it names
  pattern
    try {
      c <- step coord check_text(files, back);
      (changed, read) <- match c {
        Refused(w, at) => raise Stop({why = w, at = at})
        Look(f, by, r) =>
          d <- decide look-read(by);
          match d {
            No(w) => raise Stop({why = w, at = []})
            Go => return (f, r)
            Read =>
              v <- try { step role lead read_text(why, by, [], f) } handle {
                NoWorker(w) => return No("This change is read first by the project's lead, and no lead is running now (the registry says who is): nothing changed. Open it again when one runs.")
              };
              match v {
                No(w) => raise Stop({why = w, at = []})
                Go => return (f, r)
              }
          }
        Checks(f, by, kinds, calls, renderings, views, policy, library, shadows, bindings, handlers, r) =>
          d <- decide text-read(by, kinds, calls, renderings, views, policy, library, shadows, bindings, handlers);
          match d {
            No(w) => raise Stop({why = w, at = []})
            Go => return (f, r)
            Read =>
              v <- try { step role text-reader read_text(why, by, kinds ++ calls ++ renderings ++ views ++ policy ++ library, f) } handle {
                NoWorker(w) => return No("This change is read first, and nobody who may read it is running now (the project's policy says who: the role `text-reader`, by default its lead): nothing changed. Open it again when one runs.")
              };
              match v {
                No(w) => raise Stop({why = w, at = []})
                Go => return (f, r)
              }
          }
      };
      l <- step coord load_text(changed, read, why);
      commit <- match l {
        Refused(w, at) => raise Stop({why = w, at = at})
        Live(c) => return c
      };
      s <- step coord still_text(changed, commit);
      match s {
        Own => return Live(commit, none)
        Unseen(w) => return Unseen(commit, w)
        Still(path, by, page) =>
          a <- step by look_at(why, path, page);
          match a {
            LooksRight => return Live(commit, path)
            Wrong(what) =>
              try {
                b <- step coord check_text([], commit);
                (bf, br) <- match b {
                  Refused(w, at) => raise Stop({why = w, at = at})
                  Look(f, by2, r) => return (f, r)
                  Checks(f, by2, k, cl, re, vi, po, li, sh, bi, ha, r) => return (f, r)
                };
                bl <- step coord load_text(bf, br, what);
                match bl {
                  Live(c) => return Back(what, path, c)
                  Refused(w, at) => raise Stop({why = w, at = at})
                }
              } handle {
                Stop(e) => return Stuck(what, path, e.why)
              }
          }
      }
    } handle {
      Stop(e) => return Refused(e.why, e.at)
    }
